36w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/500576ddd085cb3dbc17464ce95d47a4/af1fa/art-night-flyer.jpg\"\n            alt=\"2nd Saturday Art Night Flyer\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><strong>Join us for 2nd Saturday Art Night: MLAA Art Party</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Saturday, November 14, 2026, 5:00–6:00 p.m.</strong></p>\n<p>Goodness Cafe, 1 S. Washington St., Sonora</p>\n<p>Create a Poetography piece of your own with artist, writer &#x26; facilitator Marianne Hale Levitan. Bring a photo of a beloved person or place, and leave with words of gratitude or blessing, written by you, to honor them. Just in time for Thanksgiving!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instruction and materials are FREE! Bring your own photo if you like.</li>\n<li>Please no outside food or drink. Goodness Cafe has wonderful treats to purchase!</li>\n<li>2027 Poetography Calendars available for sale — limited edition of 50</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Poetography (n.): The meeting of photograph and poem — where what the eye sees and the heart hears become one.</em></p>\n<p>Mother Lode Art Association: <a href=\"https://www.mlaa.org\">https://www.mlaa.org</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"2nd Saturday Art Night: MLAA Art Party, November 14th","date":"November 14, 2026","description":"Create a Poetography piece of your own with artist, writer & facilitator Marianne Hale Levitan. Saturday, November 14th, 5:00–6:00 p.m. at Goodness Cafe, 1 S. Washington St., Sonora. Instruction and materials are FREE!"}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/events/oct-30-boo-etry/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"The Boo-etry: A Spooky, Ghostly, Eerie Celebration — October 30th"}